; What this project is pinned to.
;   root — overlay roots, first listed wins:
;          "deps" — our own copy of the x-lang library modules we import
;          "."    — this repo itself, so maze/… resolves to maze/ in the
;                   standard layout (maze/grid@1.2.x provides maze/grid)
;          deps must stay first: the lockfile is named after the first root
;          (deps.lock.xon), and the wrapper's engine-pairing guard reads it
;          from there -- reorder and the guard silently stops firing
;          (x-lang#313). Safe only because deps/ holds no maze/ modules;
;          do NOT run (Pin sync) until x-lang#223 lands, as it re-vendors
;          this project's own modules into deps/ where they would shadow
;          the real files.
;   src  — the tree the pin verbs scan to work out what to vendor
;   boot — the language itself: a verified amalgam from a release
(root "deps")
(root ".")
(src "maze")
(boot "boot/he.x")
